graph TD
  U[User types message] --> CI[Renderer: ChatInput submit]
  CI --> RS[Renderer store dispatch sendMessage]
  RS --> IPC[Electron IPC call chat.streamAssistantResponse]
  IPC --> MP[Main: chat-service]
  MP --> WF[LangGraph workflow run]
  WF -->|content updates| UI[Renderer receives stream chunks]
  WF -->|interrupt await_user_input| INT[Await user input]
  INT --> ST[Renderer shows awaiting banner + prompt]
  ST --> RESUME[User provides answer]
  RESUME --> IPC2[Renderer calls chat.streamAssistantResponse with checkpointId]
  IPC2 --> WF2[Workflow resumes from checkpoint]
  WF2 --> UI
  WF2 -->|Complete/Breaker| DONE[Conversation status active/ended]
